  "expansion_note": "Complete list/table/turn/Q&A context may exceed requested count; original blocks unchanged.",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "block-000465-5b6a12d2",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[497]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 465,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "TAC as a percentage of revenues generated from ads placed on Google Network properties are significantly higher than TAC as a percentage of revenues generated from ads placed on Google Search & other properties, because most of the advertiser revenues from ads served on Google Network properties are paid as TAC to our Google Network partners.",
      "text_hash": "5b6a12d24b75e80c03f717f2328dbc961d246a45d4b0cf5b3c09024ffc3e76f7",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000466-8d9f0abc",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[498]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 466,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-style": "italic",
        "font-weight": "700",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Operating Expenses",
      "text_hash": "8d9f0abc240227783359392c24b9c276840201b99ed75c06fd619bb3f0d21983",
      "type": "heading_candidate"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000467-70e32c88",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[499]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 467,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Operating expenses are generally incurred during our normal course of business, which we categorize as either research and development, sales and marketing, or general and administrative.",
      "text_hash": "70e32c889e971368df7a52db802597de63eb89cdc667dce4fdc9c348482c5bb8",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000468-4e690c1b",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[500]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 468,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "The main components of our research and development expenses are:",
      "text_hash": "4e690c1b1be9e336efee7b9344bae33fbb98f3ca783021c1bd9c25fa6d2416f3",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000469-856cca43",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[501]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 469,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "padding-left": "36pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "-18pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "•depreciation expense, primarily related to our technical infrastructure;",
      "text_hash": "856cca43110f5c431ed8cfb0eff2a98018ea84c8bbb86a384375cc8463ec680e",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000470-f3cddcc6",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[502]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 470,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "padding-left": "36pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "-18pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "•employee compensation expenses for engineering and technical employees responsible for research and development related to our existing and new products and services;",
      "text_hash": "f3cddcc6a2e772e3cc12e0e995598ae30a01843629d669e6111d63d3eb0aa5a1",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000471-aa553578",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[503]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 471,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "padding-left": "36pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "-18pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "•other technical infrastructure operations costs, including energy, equipment, and network capacity costs; and",
      "text_hash": "aa5535787352ebe34dda282bb9326fe05ac320e2d825291a9d16758ecc259cd0",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000472-91d8a0fa",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[504]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 472,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "padding-left": "36pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "-18pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "•third-party services fees primarily relating to consulting and outsourced services in support of our engineering and product development efforts.",
      "text_hash": "91d8a0fa51dba0cc73fd07417944858c22db896c5c915e22ca3bf285c5ed64c1",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000473-95590e4b",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[505]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 473,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "The main components of our sales and marketing expenses are:",
      "text_hash": "95590e4b76b06f4506986cff59312c76ea1236956a512fbed4c4849a2361f10a",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000474-32fa5e9b",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[506]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 474,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "padding-left": "36pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "-18pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "•employee compensation expenses for employees engaged in sales and marketing, sales support, and certain customer service functions; and",
      "text_hash": "32fa5e9be8a6b9c1b322f2a9b36ded0474c42b424a455cced5a4de5fd4b21eb0",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000475-c2b8e902",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[507]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 475,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "padding-left": "36pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "-18pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "•spend relating to our advertising and promotional activities in support of our products and services.",
      "text_hash": "c2b8e902fe15bd1c184bca88d86986d6be75a91f70abd44485d4f0ff592f64d3",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000476-b57ab9c8",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[508]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 476,
      "reported_page": 31,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "The main components of our general and administrative expenses are:",
      "text_hash": "b57ab9c88df04db35e62580d78f4210beb741fd8ff7db57ffa64cb2683e48e34",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
