        "text-indent": "-18pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "•employee compensation expenses for employees in finance, human resources, information technology, legal, and other administrative support functions;",
      "text_hash": "0a31f91c52fabb8918db275402697512dff5f9dc6e9ea682570a0963d46738aa",
